@ [source_snapshot_uuid] e8a63d6a-60f1-46c3-add5-73327a0029ae

& [InputGraph]
  + PreflightEvidenceManifest owns sorted direct-child ArtifactIdentity values with bounded bytes and uppercase SHA256
  + UpstreamJoin owns exact B0 request result SWA-04A request proposal CandidateWorkspaceRequest prior AdmissionReceipt and current AdmissionReceipt machine-form bytes plus lowercase content digests
  + HostIdentity owns executable canonical path bytes digest version provenance standard-schema digest experimental-schema digest and pre-post identities
  + Commission owns profile name filesystem rules network rule closed environment canonical roots process contract resource budget capability account and one-use correlation

& [PhysicalObservation]
  + TranscriptFrame is a closed initialize initialized profile-list command-success command-refusal sequence with exact ids and bounded admitted notifications
  + CanaryAccount owns allowed-read sentinel denied-read sentinel absent denied-write canary before and after plus exact attempted command identities
  + InventoryEntry owns normalized relative path kind bytes mode and content digest for every admitted stable scratch member
  + ProcessAccount owns one direct child identity started terminal interrupted terminated reaped descendant late-output elapsed stdout stderr and executable rehash facts
  + ConsequenceAccount owns physical_contact may_have_mutated quarantine_required cleanup_performed first_fault and reusable flags

& [Output]
  + B1PermissionProfilePreflightReceipt owns profile source predecessor upstream join digests commission digest manifest digest observation digest status authority all proved predicates all zero-effect counts consequence fields and self-digest
  + success status has one value preflight_eligible_writer_not_run and authority has one value preflight_observation_only
  + refusal is a typed B1PermissionProfilePreflightFault with closed code bounded message physical-contact consequence and no partial receipt

& [Bounds]
  + evidence contains a fixed artifact set each at most 16 MiB total artifact bytes at most 48 MiB and machine form at most 2 MiB
  + upstream forms transcript notifications inventory entries environment entries paths arguments fields and nesting each have explicit maxima fixed by the canonical specification
  + one App Server process zero model turns zero provider calls zero MCP calls zero Git-history commit or push calls and zero cleanup actions are permitted

& [ValidationOrder]
  + root metadata direct-child path and artifact identities precede parsing
  + duplicate-free strict JSON and canonical LF machine forms precede typed semantics
  + source predecessor upstream replay commission capability environment topology and resources precede physical observation validation
  + process terminal canaries and complete inventories precede consequence adjudication
  + authority zero-effect account and domain-separated self-digest are last

& [Determinism]
  + BTree ordering fixed artifact order canonical relative paths canonical JSON serialization and domain separation eliminate ambient map path clock and filesystem enumeration order
  + producer observation contains exact physical values while verifier receipt contains no observation time random identifier or ambient selection

& [NonAuthority]
  + serialized values never decode into process filesystem Git provider reviewer signer activation or cleanup handles
  + preflight eligibility supports later B2 formation only and cannot launch or authorize the writer
